Should you find a polytrap or means to polymorph yourself, you could
turn into a gray dragon, maybe lay eggs (if you're female), let the
baby dragons grow into adulthood and let them die in hope of scales.
One lich in rogue level shouldn't be a problem... wear junk/spare
armor and kill it quickly. Visit rogue quickly and use telepathy
with "what's over there" - command to see if the lich is a high lich
(those who use touch of death).

After you've dealt with the lich, you could try solving the quest (after
gaining a couple of experience levels) so you can get your hands on the
Mirror. Killing Ixoth without MR but with sneaky tactics is risky,
but possible.

